# Bulk raw extracts. These are a download cache, not source data: each source's
# ingest.R rebuilds any that are missing. Excluded because they dominate the
# repo (77 MB for nces_acs_ed against 35 MB of standardized output) and are
# rewritten whenever a vintage is refreshed. Rebuilding nces_acs_ed's takes
# roughly 50 minutes of EDGE API calls -- see data/nces_acs_ed/README.md.
#
# The codebook_*.csv.xz files alongside them are deliberately NOT ignored: they
# total 85 KB and record every ACS cell's label and ancestor path per vintage,
# which is what the ingest matches against and what you read when a measure
# comes out NA for a vintage.
data/nces_acs_ed/raw/cells_*.csv.xz
